<section id="hero">
  <div class="hero-left">
    <div class="hero-status r-up">
      <span class="sdot"></span>
      Disponible para proyectos
    </div>
    <h1 class="hero-name r-up d1">
      Diseño &amp; código,<br />
      <span class="hero-name-outline">Miguel del Angel Queb Silva.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-role r-up d2">Diseñador · Desarrollador · Explorador</p>
    <p class="hero-bio r-up d3">
      Vivo en Campeche, México, construyendo desde la intersección
      del diseño y el código. Me interesan las interfaces que se
      sienten vivas, los sistemas que escalan sin perder alma,
      y los proyectos que resuelven algo real.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-links r-up d4">
      <a href="mailto:hola@tunombre.com" class="hl primary">
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/>
          <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/>
        </svg>
        Escríbeme
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/" class="hl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0 1 12 6.844a9.59 9.59 0 0 1 2.504.337c1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.02 10.02 0 0 0 22 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z"/>
        </svg>
        GitHub
      </a>
      <a href="https://twitter.com/" class="hl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-4.714-6.231-5.401 6.231H2.748l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.259 5.63 5.905-5.63Zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/>
        </svg>
        Twitter
